{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"Hampstead","id":"851195612049309766","name":"ricker-lent-smith-homestead-and-cemetery☕⚰","position":107,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Bo nods. \"Will do fella! Though he does tend to show himself when HE wants... Might be a futile endeavor, but I will ask nevertheless.\" He bows. \"If you'll excuse me, I do yet have another I must seek out.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T17:21:01.820000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867456146243059752","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Apgan will lean against a tree and watch as Bo leaves.","created_at":"2021-07-21T17:21:40.723000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867456309413543936","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"He waves back to Apgan as he walks off.","created_at":"2021-07-21T17:24:45.863000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867457085948297226","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Off to <#861700807626588220>","created_at":"2021-07-21T17:24:54.225000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867457121020936193","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Apgan will enter walk up to Mr. Smith. \"Mind if I give you a hand tending the cemetary? Or would I get the soil too wet?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T17:27:02.061000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867457657202540615","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Oh, not at all, not at all, please grab a shovel, the soil is already quite damp as is.\" The Elderly Aljarad continues to dig even as the ground turns to mud at the bottom.","created_at":"2021-07-21T17:34:04.066000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867459427220062228","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Apgan digs, powerfully. \"Have you heard about Buchanan, Mr. Smith?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T17:45:11.446000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867462226415583262","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Mr. Smith pauses a moment looking thoughtful, using a white handkerchief to wipe mud from his chin. \"Hmm, I believe there may be a Jane Buchanan buried somewhere on these grounds...\" The elderly man says after a few moments.","created_at":"2021-07-21T17:55:26.614000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T17:55:34.945000Z","id":"867464806616006706","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Interesting. I was referring to a living shadow by the name of Buchanan in Kingsbridge. Former head of the lamplighters.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T17:56:52.838000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867465168267116624","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Do you know if there is any relation?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T17:57:37.570000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867465355886854164","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Ah, that Buchanan, forgive me, I find my thoughts devoted to the dead more often than the living most days... I never met the man myself, but perhaps. She passed in the year... 1740, if my memory still preserves.\" Mr. Smith says climbing out of the nearly finished grave and leaning his shovel against a tree. \"My, I'm feeling as though I need a break, would you by chance like to join me for Tea?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T17:59:29.409000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867465824973357067","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Naturally.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:01:02.904000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867466217119285258","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Proceeding back to the homestead, Mr. Smith beckons you to take a seat in the tea room while he prepares refreshment.","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:02:11.231000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867466503703887902","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Apgan stands awkwardly, not wanting to soak Mr. Smith's furniture.","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:03:06.895000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867466737174446116","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"He makes his way into the bathroom, and grabs a couple of towels to sit on.","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:03:54.751000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867466937898237962","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Your cloud follows you through the house leaving a trail on the decades old carpets. Mr. Smith returns carrying a tray, steam rising from the antique teapot. \n\"This is Anise, very sweet, good for calming upset stomachs.\" Mr. Smith says as he pours two cups and sets them on the table between the two of you.","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:06:26.541000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867467574551904266","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Ah you remembered I like it sweet!\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:07:02.730000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867467726339309588","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"The first time I was here we talked about politics. The second, we went into the sewers and three of us died. All came back, but that's normal for Empire City, isn't it?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:08:38.945000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867468129893220404","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Meanwhile you tend a garden of those who have payed their drachmae.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:08:56.604000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T18:09:16.219000Z","id":"867468203961745448","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Mr. Smith nods with a smile as sips his tea. He nods again sadly as you bring up the excursion through the sewers. \"Yes... Things can change quite rapidly in this city, one day you are tending your garden, or acquiring a drink with friends, the next the Kings men are taking your friends and neighbors from their homes, to be brought to war...\" Aljarad says with a somber tone.","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:10:23.818000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T18:10:45.531000Z","id":"867468569763512340","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"I presume you haven't given up your loyalist bent, though. And such would always be the price of peace here.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:12:09.026000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867469011037192222","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Look at us, already discussing politics again. I must try to be more polite.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:13:38.503000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867469386332110878","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Mr. Smith eyes you from across the table, and takes a sip of his tea. \"Indeed.\" \nThere is a moment of silence before he continues, \"regardless, you asked about a mr. Buchanan? Those living shadows... Quite marvelous are they not? I have not had the chance to meet many, but those I have interacted with have always come off as rather unique individuals.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:14:16.617000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867469546192109588","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Indeed, Mr. Buchanan was a rather unique individual. Given what we've learned since being invited into the lamplighter office, it seems he used his position rather poorly.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:16:20.892000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867470067440943114","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Mmm, and unfortunate bit of news to hear... I take it there is another sitting as the head of the lamplighters now?\" Mr. Smith asks. \"Oh and do tell me if you would like a refill.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:17:41.913000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867470407267123291","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Nolan Reeve. A fine individual, if I am any judge of character, though I do not claim to be.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:18:57.613000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T18:19:02.143000Z","id":"867470724774887424","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Yes, a refill, if you would.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:19:14.761000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867470796699598869","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Mr. Smith refills both of your cups, the tea has a natural sweetness akin to licorice.\n\"Ah yes, I remember him, he seemed a reasonable individual. An interesting manner of speaking.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:20:41.664000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T18:20:53.202000Z","id":"867471161197068328","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Buchanan is wanted by the current lamplighters--that is to say Nolan and I, for his crimes against Kingsbridge. But...\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:22:44.346000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867471675762278410","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"We suspect his location is known to the British Army, to put it bluntly.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:23:20.484000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867471827336429578","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Interesting...\" Aljarad comments listening intently.","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:23:50.625000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867471953757077514","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Nolan and I are Patriots, but we are loyal to the Lamplighters and to Empire City before we are loyal to the cause.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:24:57.163000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T18:25:05.710000Z","id":"867472232836890676","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"And you are a Loyalist, but I know you feel the same.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:25:32.961000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T18:26:13.253000Z","id":"867472382986158150","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"A reasonable assumption my friend, and you would be correct, the people of this city are important to me... Tell me, what is it you plan to do if I may ask?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:26:34.804000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867472642373976084","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"We hope to arrest Buchanan and see that he faces justice for his corruption of the office and participation in a criminal conspiracy.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:28:03.249000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867473013339455488","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"I come to you because, as a respected Loyalist, you may have ways of finding Buchanan that are not available to me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:28:58.228000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867473243936915476","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Mr. Smith nods. \"Mm, I am afraid there is not much I can do here, for I am but one old groundskeeper, In have very little authority beyond arrangements for the dead.\" Mr. Smith says with a small smile accompanied by a sigh. \"But you do have my co-operation, if there is any information as to the whereabouts of this man, that I manage to pick up, I shall pass it along to either you or Mr. Reeve.\" Aljarad says with a small nod.","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:31:27.849000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867473871493398588","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Is there any you know, who I might make this same entreaty to?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:32:25.408000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867474112913080330","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Mr. Smith thinks for a moment. \"Perhaps Mr. Kern, he may have some information, or atleast as a respectable member of the community that he is, could perhaps acquire such information from the townspeople. There is also... Another.\" Mr. Smith says as his expression takes on a troubled look.","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:34:11.521000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867474557983129631","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"I very much hope you are not about to say Malathor.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:34:52.375000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867474729337225256","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Ah, is that his name? I saw you speaking to him earlier... That man, I have witnessed him, *slinking* through the cemetery in the late evening, like a snake through the grass, poking around the older graves, I do not trust him... But he seems to cover alot of ground. Perhaps, if you can offer him something, he may have useful information to share.\" Mr. Smith says, though he looks doubtful in his expression.","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:37:27.923000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867475381752954891","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"The man seems to have some power and influence. Though what power and influence I cannot say. Too many mysteries with that one.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:39:25.869000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867475876454596630","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Thank you for your time, and for the tea. My curiosities have been satisfied, and my entreaty made. May I take my leave?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:40:33.659000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867476160786464808","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"My gills are beginning to dry out, even in this rain.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:41:56.378000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867476507735228477","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Mr. Smith nods graciously. \"Ofcourse, as always you are welcome anytime. Do be careful about those gills, it's very important to moisturize.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:42:29.076000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867476644880056340","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Thank you again. I wish you and your garden well.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:43:37.329000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867476931154149396","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Have a pleasant day my friend, good luck in your search.\" Mr. Smith waves to you as you exit the homestead.","created_at":"2021-07-21T18:44:46.783000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867477222465732658","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
