{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Mr Smith shows up, looking like he just freshened up with two cups of tea in hand \"hello, sorry today has been a busy one.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:20:25.882000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867954278822735873","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"<@468162764586876949>","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:20:31.752000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867954303443284029","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"“It’s- yes, it has.” She turns around, the corpse still over her shoulder. “Good evening, Mr. Smith. I’m wondering if you have a place for a new grave I can use?”","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:21:49.707000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867954630410244138","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"I have many places I can bury those that have passed on.  Would you like to have a seat and some tea while we talk arrangements?\" He motions to a bench nearby","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:22:58.912000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867954920677072897","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"“That would be lovely.” She smiled as she set the corpse on the bench, then sat down herself. “What kind of tea?”","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:25:03.508000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867955443270565918","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Tonight is a honeyed oolong chamomile blend\" he offers a cup","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:25:44.932000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867955617015431168","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"She takes the cup, holding it in her palms as usual. She took a whiff and then sipped it. “Mmm. I like it.”","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:26:52.601000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867955900839776257","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Thank you.\" He says and takes a sip himself \"so the rates go from copper to platinum.  For a single copper I can give a grave with a simple wooden cross.\" He pauses to judge interest","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:28:36.597000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867956337030611034","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"She looks at the corpse, then nods. “I.. wish I could do more, but I only just learned of his passing, and.. well, I saw it only fitting to give him some sort of burial.” She then looked at Mr. Smith again. “Would it be too much trouble to do the burial myself?”","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:31:35.415000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867957087047667733","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"I will show you the plot, and cross.  You are welcome to do it yourself free of charge\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:32:40.865000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867957361564876831","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"“Thank you, Mr. Smith.” She smiles as she sips from the cup.","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:34:05.787000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867957717753536522","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"He stands \"enjoy the tea while I fetch you a shovel\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:34:55.202000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867957925015064627","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"She nods and waits, taking a sip from the cup. Depending how tattered the uniform is, she’ll cast Mending to repair it. If not.. oh well.","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:36:58.297000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867958441312915556","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
