{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"She laid the corpse down, and nodded. “Once again, thank you, Mr. Smith.”","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:41:05.443000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867959477918376007","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
