{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Once she had finished digging the grave, she climbed out. Picking up the corpse, she laid it down, resting it comfortably. Setting it's arms so they are tucked in beside the body, she began a small ritual in keeping with the old practices. Taking a copper piece, she placed as a Charon's obol. Switching to Celestial, she began speaking. `\"Despite being enemies, Death is the end of us all. In death, we will be taken from the world of the living to the world of the dead. There, and only there, we are all one in the same. I pray that you find your way, soldier, to the world of the dead.\"`  She then to cover the body. Once she had finished, she stuck the shovel in the ground, and gave a small prayer to Athena before picking up her bag and making her way back to the streets.","created_at":"2021-07-23T03:11:22.770000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867967100340281374","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
